  "exact_differences_that_matter": [
    "DS1621 platform0 uses six requested roots:12..15 x4->01.1,11..8 reversed x4->01.2,0..1 x2->01.3,2..3 x2->01.4,4..5 x2->01.5,6..7 x2->01.6.",
    "DS1525 platform0 also combines0..1 asx2, but requests01.6 and uses a different complete lane set.",
    "The DS1522 candidate instead requests logical1 x1->01.4 and logical0 x1->01.5. Neither reference validates that exact split plus BDF combination."
  ],
