  "limits": [
    "Factory applicability is inferred from executable selection and the matching shipped device tree, not a DS1621 hardware boot trace.",
    "All BDF values here are requested descriptor values. Successful lane training and final PCI enumeration were not observed.",
    "A working x2 use does not prove independent x1+x1 support, and does not establish a prohibition either.",
    "No physical pin equivalence between DS1621 and DS1522 is inferred, and their GPIO/clock layouts must not be transplanted on this evidence.",
    "This comparison cannot resolve the failed DS1522 replacement chip's actual classification or the exact candidate's hardware behavior."
  ],
